[[63,7,16896,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584819\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Drain the high and low pressure circuit\nas described in the specific operation \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584518\">1042A02</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585136\">7040A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585227\">7065A14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585156\">7040L20</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584536\">1042E60</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584530\">1042A72</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584537\">1042E62</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584701\">3380A30</a>\n                                           (left\nside).</p><p><a href=\"#/2584774\">4450B12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584541\">1044E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584831\">5040B14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584827\">5040A54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584828\">5040A72</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584745\">4410D13</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the retaining bands.</p><p>2. Release the pipe from the retaining clips under the bodywork\nand remove it from the under the rear of the vehicle.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care during the operation\nof removing and refitting the pipe not to bend or distort the actual pipe.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065934.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16896,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the condidtion of the CNG supply\npipe.</p><p>Position the pipe on the bottom of the\nbodywork and insert the front end into the engine compartment.</p><p>Secure the pipe on the bottom of the bodywork\nto the clips and bands using bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584745\">4410D13</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584828\">5040A72</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584827\">5040A54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584827\">5040A54</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584831\">5040B14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584541\">1044E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585261\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584774\">4450B12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584701\">3380A30</a>\n                                           (left\nside).</p><p><a href=\"#/2584537\">1042E62</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584530\">1042A72</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584536\">1042E60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Lower the vehicle on the lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585156\">7040L20</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585227\">7065A14</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2585136\">7040A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2584819\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Manually set the CNG cut-off solenoids\nto the open position and check that the system is working.</p><p>Connect the Examiner diagnostic instrument\nin the &#x27;Active Diagnosis&#x27; environment, and select and run &#x27;Gas solenoid\nrelay&#x27; to allow the solenoids to open and</p>"]]